#: ../../../index.rst:6
msgid "Welcome to Syncthing's documentation!"
msgstr "歡迎閱讀 Syncthing 文件！"

#: ../../../index.rst:8
msgid ""
"As a new user, the :ref:`getting started guide <getting-started>` is a good "
"place to start, then perhaps moving on to :ref:`the FAQ <faq>`. If you run "
"into trouble getting devices to connect to each other, the page about :ref:"
"`firewall setup <firewall-setup>` explains the networking necessary to get "
"it to work."
msgstr ""
"新使用者可以從\\ :ref:`開始使用指南 <getting-started>`\\ 開始，接著或許可以參"
"考\\ :ref:`常見問題 <faq>`\\ 。如果在裝置之間連接遇到問題，\\ :ref:`防火牆設"
"定 <firewall-setup>`\\ 頁面會解釋需要哪些網路設定才能讓它正常運作。"

#: ../../../index.rst:14
msgid ""
"As a developer looking to get started with a contribution, see :ref:`how to "
"build <building>`, :ref:`how to debug <debugging>` and the `contribution "
"guidelines`_. This documentation site can be edited on GitHub_."
msgstr ""
"開發人員如果想要開始貢獻，請參見\\ :ref:`如何建置 <building>`\\ 、\\ :ref:`如"
"何偵錯 <debugging>`\\ ，以及\\ `貢獻指南 <contribution guidelines_>`_\\ 。本"
"文件網站可以在 GitHub_ 上編輯。"

#: ../../../index.rst:19
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "聯絡方式"

#: ../../../index.rst:21
msgid ""
"If you're looking for specific people to talk to, check out the :ref:"
"`project-presentation`."
msgstr "如果您想聯絡特定的人員，請參閱 :ref:`project-presentation`。"

#: ../../../index.rst:24
msgid ""
"To report bugs or request features, please use the `issue tracker`_. Before "
"you do so, make sure you are running the `latest version`_, and please do a "
"quick search to see if the issue has already been reported."
msgstr ""
"若要回報臭蟲或請求功能，請使用\\ `議題追蹤器 <issue tracker_>`_\\ 。在進行之"
"前，請確認您正在執行\\ `最新版本 <latest version_>`_\\ ，並快速搜尋以確認該議"
"題是否已經被回報。"

#: ../../../index.rst:30
msgid ""
"To report security issues, please follow the instructions on the `Security "
"page`_."
msgstr ""
"若要回報安全性議題，請依照\\ `安全頁面 <Security page_>`_\\ 上的指示操作。"

#: ../../../index.rst:33
msgid ""
"To get help and support, discuss scenarios, or just connect with other users "
"and developers you can head over to the `friendly forum`_."
msgstr ""
"若要獲得幫助與支援、討論使用情境，或是與其他使用者及開發者聯繫，您可以前往\\ "
"`友善的論壇 <friendly forum_>`_。"

#: ../../../index.rst:36
msgid ""
"For other concerns you may reach out to members of the maintainers, "
"currently :user:`calmh`, :user:`AudriusButkevicius` and :user:`imsodin`."
msgstr ""
"如有其他事項，您可以聯絡維護者成員，目前為 :user:`calmh`、:user:"
"`AudriusButkevicius` 與 :user:`imsodin`。"

